    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d269">

                <pb facs="0487" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116EW/1–345</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Secretary of State
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d269-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-03">January 3,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary of State</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Please send me a brief report on the status of the proceedings before the War
                    Crimes Commission, and particularly the attitude of the U. S. representative on
                    offenses to be brought against Hitler and
                    the chief Nazi war criminals. The charges should include an indictment for
                    waging aggressive and unprovoked warfare, in violation of the Kellogg Pact.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d269-f2"/>
                    Perhaps these and other charges might be joined in a conspiracy indictment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D.
                                R[<hi rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
